{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CfLsWCgJJeCtCx5iD8oQF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I need to fix existing tests that query `[role=\"gridcell\"]` expecting the button directly. Many tests do `querySelector('[role=\"gridcell\"]')` and treat it as a button. Now gridcell is a div wrapper. Let me update the existing tests that need fixing.\n\nThe tests that query gridcells and click/interact with them need to target the button inside. Let me check which tests need updating:\n\n1. \"renders category tabs and an eight-column grid\" - queries gridcells for text content, should still work since textContent bubbles up\n2. \"emits emoji-select and closes after selection\" - finds gridcell by textContent then clicks -- needs to find the button\n3. \"supports keyboard grid navigation and dismissal\" - queries gridcells, focuses first -- needs buttons\n4. \"ArrowDown in search box moves focus into grid\" - queries gridcell, checks activeElement -- now the button gets focus\n5. \"search filters visible emoji\" - checks grid textContent -- should still work\n6. \"stores and restores recents\" - queries gridcells by textContent and clicks -- needs buttons\n7. \"applies and restores skin tone\" - queries gridcell then clicks -- needs button\n8. \"updates preview when hovered\" - dispatches mouseenter on gridcell -- needs button\n9. \"inserts into field named by for\" - clicks gridcell button -- needs button\n\nLet me update these tests. The key pattern change: `querySelector('[role=\"gridcell\"]')` that expects a clickable/focusable element should become `querySelector('[role=\"gridcell\"] button')`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":439,"cache_read_input_tokens":67848,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":439},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93aea7ef-73f5-4eca-91f2-b7af54f52bc5","uuid":"d4a12654-ab9b-4b8d-8aa7-d8bc0aa9a46e","timestamp":"2026-09-23T18:49:13.057Z","request_id":"req_011CfLsWCFzKmiyVNVtta9DG"}
